This is the expert pool's frame surface. `frames()` is how many frames are backed now and `frame_limit()` how many the pool can back at most; `frames_` and `limit_` are its only frame-count state. Add one accessor that returns how many frames the pool can still back, keeping the existing accessors unchanged.

